# Elysian House production domain

The live site uses **only** `elysianhouseglobal.com` (apex and `www`).

When editing **`api/_send-contact.ts`** (or any API that validates **CORS** / allowed origins):

- Include `https://elysianhouseglobal.com` and `https://www.elysianhouseglobal.com` for production.
- Do **not** add or reintroduce `elysianhouse.com` or `www.elysianhouse.com` — that hostname is not in use.

Keep localhost and Vercel preview origins as needed for development.
